She is a member of the South Korean girl group EXID.","title":"Park Jeong-hwa","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Park_Jeong-hwa"}},"Q24150770":{"id":"Q24150770","name":"Yohan Hwang","ko":"황요한","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1995-11-27","death":"","birthplace":"Goyang","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2016","agencies":[{"name":"Star Music","korean":false,"id":"Q4667782","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yohan/","x":"https://x.com/imyohanhwang"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Yohan Hwang, also known as Yohan King, is a South Korean singer based in Manila, Philippines. He rose to fame after joining and eventually winning the first season of I Love OPM. Yohan later went on to perform a Korean-language cover of the Yeng Constantino single \"Ikaw\" for the Tagalog-language dub of Love in the Moonlight.","title":"Yohan Hwang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yohan_Hwang"}},"Q27953522":{"id":"Q27953522","name":"Woodz","ko":"우즈","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Cho Seung-youn","Luizy","Cho Seungyoun","Cho Seung Yun","Luizinho","WOODZ"],"birth":"1996-08-05","death":"","birthplace":"Gyeonggi Province","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["rapper","singer-songwriter","record producer","dancer","recording artist","model"],"debut":"2014","agencies":[{"name":"EDAM Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q85872777","start":"2022-10-25","end":""},{"name":"Yuehua Entertainment","korean":false,"id":"Q18390500","start":"2014-10-14","end":"2022-10-19"}],"groups":[{"id":"Q65665588","name":"X1","start":"2019","end":"2020"},{"id":"Q18712416","name":"Uniq","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q48937538","name":"M.O.L.A","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/woodz_dnwm/","x":"https://x.com/c_woodzofficial","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaMhpehN8xNWkVJB3ZQY0qQ","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@woodz_9696","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/6y9nlaoynxSvoTGY09Vdcy","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/25c73c37-9517-4144-8ef6-32541e82ff42"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Cho Seung-youn, known professionally as Woodz (우즈), is a South Korean singer-songwriter, rapper, and record producer. He rose to fame as the main rapper of the South Korean-Chinese boy band Uniq, formed by Yuehua Entertainment in 2014, before co-founding the musical collectives M.O.L.A in 2015 and Drinkcolor in 2016. He co-founded his personal production team, Team HOW, in 2018. He is a former member of the South Korean boy group X1. Following an appearance on the fifth season of the South Korean rap competition show Show Me the Money, Woodz debuted as a solo artist under the stage name Luizy in July 2016, with the release of the collaborative hip-hop single \"Recipe\".","title":"Woodz","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodz"}},"Q30942258":{"id":"Q30942258","name":"Kang Ji-eun","ko":"강지은","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1993-10-17","death":"","birthplace":"South Korea","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q489552","name":"LPG","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jieun_k93/","x":"https://x.com/jieun_k93","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/a43ca6ca-24fe-4262-83ef-17723897e03c"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q484850":{"id":"Q484850","name":"Yoon Kye-sang","ko":"윤계상","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Yun Kye-sang","Yun Gye-sang"],"birth":"1978-12-20","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"1999","agencies":[{"name":"JYP Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483238","start":"","end":""},{"name":"IHQ","korean":true,"id":"Q7509507","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q482380","name":"god","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kyesang78/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/fe49f67f-e2ce-42c5-b75f-234b9e4f8d9f"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Yoon Kye-sang is a South Korean actor and singer. He began his career in 1999 as part of the K-pop boy band g.o.d, then left the group in 2004 and pursued an acting career. He made his acting debut in the film Flying Boys (2004), for which he won Best New Actor at the Baeksang Arts Awards. Yoon became active in both television and film, with leading roles in romantic comedies such as My 19 Year Old Sister-in-Law (2004) and Who Are You? (2008) and the melodrama Crazy for You (2007), as well as more serious fare in The Moonlight of Seoul (2008) and The Executioner (2009).","title":"Yoon Kye-sang","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yoon_Kye-sang"},"positions":["Sub vocalist","Lead dancer"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EC%9C%A4%EA%B3%84%EC%83%81"}}},"Q489010":{"id":"Q489010","name":"Kan Mi-youn","ko":"간미연","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kan Mi Youn","Kan Miyoun","Kan Mi Yeon","Kan Mi-yeon","Kan Miyeon","Kan Mi-yun","Kan Miyun","Kan Mi Yun"],"birth":"1982-02-25","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"1997","agencies":[{"name":"DR Music","korean":true,"id":"Q17008158","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q490213","name":"Baby V.O.X.","start":"2024","end":"2006"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/miyoun_kan/","x":"https://x.com/LOVEMIYOUN","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/5tsAGzBkkAM9DtfYfJy456","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/70f8cb44-3827-4982-b2a9-f9b25e07c9bc"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/%EA%B0%84%EB%AF%B8%EC%97%B0_2021.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unsca